    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sam Hill Property is delighted to present to the market this stunning south facing end of terrace house in the ever popular Dublin 8.\r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\n\r\nOn entry you are greeted by a large living room with timbered flooring recently decorated. There is a open fire which gives the future owner heating options.\r\nTo the right is the first bedroom facing the road and further down to the right is the second bedroom which has ample light.\r\n\r\nAt the rear of the property off the living room is a large bright dining area and to the right is an open plan kitchen.\r\nOff the kitchen is a separate WC and shower room.\r\nThere is a small back yard at the rear.\r\n\r\nHeating is Gas and on street parking is available.\r\n\r\nThe property is located near Francis St. School and a stones throw away from Temple Bar, Christchurch, Stephens Green and local pubs shops and restaurants such as the Liberty Belle and the famous Francis St. The area is well served by Dublin bus,"
      },
      {
